Real bitwuzla produces two separate, jumbled error responses for the single
(get-unsat-assumptions) command here (an "unsupported command 'get-option'"
native rejection immediately followed by a second, distinct jSMTLIB-generated
error) -- a real protocol anomaly discovered while writing this test, appears
unrelated to Simplify's own gap this test targets. Needs its own investigation;
not written up as a golden since one command producing two responses is not
itself SMT-LIB-conformant.
